{'symbol': 'ROL', 'date': '2022-06-08 18:02:00', 'title': 'ROLLINS, INC. RECOGNIZED IN TOP-50 GREEN FLEETS', 'text': 'ATLANTA , JUNE 8, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ROLLINS, INC. (NYSE: ROL), A PREMIER GLOBAL CONSUMER AND COMMERCIAL SERVICES COMPANY, ANNOUNCED TODAY IT HAS BEEN RECOGNIZED BY BMW GROUP, RANKING ITS FLEET AT NUMBER 15 IN THE TOP-50 GREEN FLEETS. WITH 1,285 FLEX FUEL VEHICLES, 435 HYBRID ELECTRIC VEHICLES, 5 ELECTRIC VEHICLES AND 1 CNG POWERED VEHICLE, THE ROLLINS FLEET IS MAKING A POSITIVE IMPACT ON REDUCING OVERALL CARBON EMISSIONS AND THEIR IMPACT ON CLIMATE CHANGE.'}